eated":"2024-08-23T15:46:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-23T15:50:04+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Switzerland-based software-as-a-service startup dacadoo aims to help people improve their health and wellbeing through its digital health engagement solutions. The company has customers around the globe, so processing data securely and in line with laws like the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) in Europe and the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) in the US is vital. Geoffrey Schiavon, dacadoo’s head of marketing and client success, talks about delivering a compelling experience to customers’ end users, and how support from AWS is a winner.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Dacadoo%20Logo.ffc48d2142157608dfc74a14c326f56697b861c1.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Dacadoo%20Logo.ffc48d2142157608dfc74a14c326f56697b861c1.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"dacadoo","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2024-08-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/dacadoo-data-protection/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"dacadoo","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"dacadoo Keeps Data Secure, Compliant for Customers Worldwide Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Mobile","description":"Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-22T20:28:38+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market Territory (MMT)","description":"Mid-Market Territory (MMT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#dynamodb","locale":"en_US