costs. The company offers managed blockchain services designed to ease Web3 development across the globe.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/chainstack_logo%401x.c9aa5351231f404a61e4b64b2e62929c1ea60a96.png","displayLocation":"Singapore","customerNameLower":"chainstack","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-06-07","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/chainstack-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Chainstack","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Chainstack Leverages AWS to Help Thousands of Web3 Developers Reliably Scale Blockchain Applications"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Startup","description":"Startup","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:51+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#asean","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"ASEAN","description":"ASEAN","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T03:53:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#singapore","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Singapore","description":"Singapore","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#route53","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Route 53","description":"Amazon Route 53","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#blockchain","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Blockchain","description":"Blockchain","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eks","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#blockchain","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Blockchain","description":"Blockchain","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-07T17:22:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Startup (SUP)","description":"Startup (SUP)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ebs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Block Store (EBS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Block Store (EBS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#jump","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"jump","dateCreated":"2023-07-17T23:44:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T22:26:57+0000","additionalFields":{"videoSrcUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003d6Uq9Qvtzitw","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eJump facilite le quotidien des personnes souhaitant devenir freelances en leur proposant de les embaucher en CDI - tout en restant leur propre patron sans avoir \u0026agrave; g\u0026eacute;rer le volet administratif. Sebastian CACERES, CTO chez Jump, partage l\u0026rsquo;ambition de multiplier par 5 le nombre de salari\u0026eacute;s freelances d\u0026rsquo;ici fin 2022. Sa probl\u0026eacute;matique principale : rester proche des clients en proposant une disponibilit\u0026eacute; en continue et une structure pour ses utilisateurs. Le Cloud AWS a su fournir les fonctionnalit\u0026eacute;s permettant \u0026agrave; Jump de r\u0026eacute;pondre \u0026agrave; ses besoins de haute disponibilit\u0026eacute;, flexibilit\u0026eacute;, scalabilit\u0026eacute; et de s\u0026eacute;curit\u0026eacute; pour un investissement moindre en amont. Le passage au cloud a eu pour effet d\u0026rsquo;offrir plus d\u0026rsquo;agilit\u0026eacute; \u0026agrave; Jump en leur permettant de faire du test and learn gr\u0026acirc;ce aux diff\u0026eacute;rentes fonctionnalit\u0026eacute;s et services propos\u0026eacute;s. Jump souhaite aller plus loin et s\u0026rsquo;int\u0026eacute;resse aujourd\u0026rsquo;hui \u0026agrave; l\u0026rsquo;architecture bas\u0026eacute;e sur des \u0026eacute;v\u0026eacute;nements, la scalabilit\u0026eacute; et les services \u0026agrave; l\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;chelle mondiale.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6Uq9Qvtzitw/maxresdefault.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/%c3%89tude%20de%20cas%20AWS%20%20Jump.ba964f2b5a82506027f093a6dd39620de314eb70.jpg","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"jump","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Services professionnels","sortDate":"2022-06-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/jump/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Jump","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"Jump : Une solution innovante pour les freelances en recherche d’une proximité client toujours plus forte"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lightsail","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Lightsail","description":"Amazon Lightsail","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:47+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#gamelift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon GameLift","description":"Amazon GameLift","dateCreated":"2020