cause the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#big-rocks#aws-for-data","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#big-rocks","name":"AWS for Data","description":"\u003cp\u003eAWS for Data is a marketing \u0026ldquo;Big Rock\u0026rdquo; initiative that tells the story around how AWS can provide the most comprehensive set of data capabilities spanning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#appsflyer-security","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"appsflyer-security","dateCreated":"2021-04-16T23:08:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T20:27:16+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Mobile attribution company AppsFlyer built a serverless solution for half the price and used Amazon GuardDuty to detect malicious activity as well as other AWS security services to better protect its customers.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/US/AppsFlyer%20logo.33e69466becdd200a58929facf8ebde2d8cf94e5.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Digital Marketing","sortDate":"2021-04-16","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/appsflyer-security/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"AppsFlyer","enableShare":"1