 wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#jooycar","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"jooycar","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:11:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:34+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Jooycar se funda en 2014 con el reto de entregar seguros de auto de una forma distinta y revolucionar la forma a través de la cual las personas se relacionan con un seguro de auto. A partir del 2018, Jooycar experimenta un crecimiento muy acelerado al identificar que los usuarios de su tecnología pagaban un 40% menos por su seguro. La empresa evolucionó sus servicios y multiplicó en promedia cada año en tres veces su volumen con una infraestructura basada en Amazon Web Services. Rodrigo Labbé, CEO de Jooycar, y Gonzalo Vásquez, CTO de la empresa, explican cuáles son los principales servicios utilizados por la compañía y cómo AWS le ha permitido triplicar su cartera de clientes sin problemas de infraestructura y aun reduciendo el costo individual por usuario.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/jooycar-logo%401x.24703b2a40081684bda2fc28615b225847e25137.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Semiconductors","sortDate":"2021-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/jooycar/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Jooycar","headline":"Jooycar triplica negocios a la vez de lograr reducir costos con AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#fargate","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Fargate","description":"AWS Fargate","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#batch-processing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Batch Processing","description":"Batch Processing","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-26T01:35:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ecr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Container Registry (ECR)","description":"Amazon Elastic Container Registry (ECR)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#api-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon API Gateway","description":"Amazon API Gateway","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cost-usage-report","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Cost and Usage Report","description":"AWS Cost and Usage Report","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#mgmt-console","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Management Console","description":"AWS Management Console","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sagemaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon SageMaker