ng \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-clicthat","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-clicthat","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:50:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:42+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"ClicThat is a United Kingdom-based e-commerce company that offers a collaborative online auction platform to businesses and consumers. By moving its infrastructure to AWS, the company reduced its costs by 70 percent over traditional hardware-based infrastructures.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/logos/customers/clicthat-logo.5fe3b5b2c902014a4080d42a97367fbf5fbf5ea9.png","displayLocation":"United Kingdom","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eClicThat is a UK-based e-commerce company that offers a collaborative online auction platform to businesses and consumers. When it was ready to launch, the company turned to AWS to run its platform to ensure that it would scale with user demand. By moving its infrastructure to AWS, the company reduced its cost by 70% over traditional hardware-based infrastructures.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)","sortDate":"2015-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/clicthat/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"ClicThat","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2015","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: ClicThat"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Database Migration","description":"Database Migration","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#general-database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"General Database Migration","description":"General Database Migration","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#cpg","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)","description":"Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:03:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#website-hosting","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Website Hosting","description":"Website Hosting","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:07:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#uk","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United Kingdom","description":"United Kingdom","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:52+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+00